            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.0.10

- AWS sign-in now shows the confirmation code in Weft while authorization is waiting.
- A Continue in browser button opens the AWS authorization page after the code is visible, so you can check that the codes match before approving.
- The code clears when sign-in finishes or fails. Other AWS output stays out of activity, diagnostics, and errors.
]]></description>
